expression: "table_err(quote!(), quote!\n{\n    #[index(by_x = [x], by_x = [x], by_id = [x], by_creation_time = [x])]\n    #[index(by_missing = [nope], by_dup = [x, x], by_empty = [], by_sys =\n    [_creation_time], x = [x])] struct T { x: u32 }\n})"
---
duplicate index name `by_x`
index name `by_id` is reserved for a built-in index
index name `by_creation_time` is reserved for a built-in index
unknown field `nope` in index `by_missing`; struct `T` has no such field
